---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { FEATURED_SOURCE, OTHER_SOURCES } from "../lib/sources";
import { withBase } from "../lib/paths";
---
<BaseLayout title="关于" description="关于 D-Ai-ly 的采集与发布方式。">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1 class="page-title">关于 D-Ai-ly</h1>
    <p>
      D-Ai-ly 是一份自动更新的中文 AI / 科技资讯 blog。
      每天从公开媒体源抓取当日标题与摘要，生成「今日速报」与单篇索引页，并部署到 GitHub Pages。
    </p>
    <p>本站不转载全文，每条均提供原文链接，便于你跳转阅读完整报道。</p>

    <h2>信息源</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>{FEATURED_SOURCE.name}</strong>（置顶）
        {" · "}
        <a href={FEATURED_SOURCE.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">官网</a>
        {FEATURED_SOURCE.jumpUrl && FEATURED_SOURCE.jumpLabel && (
          <>
            {" · "}
            <a href={withBase(`jump/${FEATURED_SOURCE.id}/`)}>{FEATURED_SOURCE.jumpLabel}</a>
          </>
        )}
      </li>
      {OTHER_SOURCES.map((s) => (
        <li>
          <a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{s.name}</a>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>

    <h2>更新节奏</h2>
    <p>由 GitHub Actions 每小时定时运行爬虫并重新构建站点。也可手动触发 workflow。</p>

    <h2>仓库</h2>
    <p>
      源码与内容见
      <a href="https://github.com/gebilxs/D-Ai-ly" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        github.com/gebilxs/D-Ai-ly
      </a>
      。
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
